sequenceDiagram
  participant Ag as AI agent
  participant Sv as Harness (server)
  participant Pr as Preparer
  participant Rv as Reviewer
  participant Au as Audit log
  Ag->>Sv: Draft (e.g. a suggested test result)
  Sv->>Sv: Check shape, keys, evidence cited, figures
  alt draft breaks a rule
    Sv-->>Au: Run failed, draft rejected
  else draft passes the checks
    Sv->>Pr: Shown as a draft, never as a result
    Pr->>Sv: Concludes the test (recorded as preparer)
    Sv->>Rv: Waiting for review
    Rv->>Sv: Reviews (must be a different person)
  end
  Sv->>Au: Every step, with who and when, hash-chained
